4,1,,status,George,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope we can find a plan that truly helps our students and staff. I am a bit worried about how our timelines have been lately.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,Hello! I'm so excited to work with you all! I really want to make sure the rooms we improve are actually used and don't disrupt classes.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,Let's keep a steady pace. I believe we should look at the actual workload and the state of our older facilities before deciding.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree. However, we should also consider the actual satisfaction of the users. It's important to know if previous projects actually met their goals.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,A pleasure to be here. I suspect our budget projections might be a bit... optimistic. I'd like to see how the market has actually treated our spending.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Benjamin, that is a very practical point. I wonder if the delays we see are linked to those budget surprises you mentioned.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"That's true! But if we don't check the booking data, we might fix a room that nobody even uses! That would be so sad!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"@Yumi, usage is one thing, but the burden on the staff maintaining those rooms is another. We cannot ignore the human element.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@George, you're right. But the ""human element"" also includes the disappointment of a facility that looks good on paper but fails in practice.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Precisely, Mizuki. The gap between a polished proposal and the final invoice is often where the real story lies.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I think I will look into the delivery schedules and the site diaries. I want to see where we lose our time.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I'll go with the booking data and the post-occupancy review ratings! I want to see if people are happy with the spaces!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I will examine the bench technicians' weekly manual routines and the staffing posts since the hiring freeze.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"I will look into the post-occupancy review ratings as well, and the survey findings in the older blocks.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I shall investigate the tender records over three budget cycles and the renewal reserve for equipment bought earlier.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
