60,3,1,talk,Shizue,,I am very worried about Option A. The site diaries showed how much the weather disrupts us. It would be a risk to our calendar.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Yumi,,"Option C sounds wonderful! It's a general space, and my data shows that's exactly what we need! Everyone would be so happy!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,George,,Option D is the only choice that makes sense. The technicians are struggling with manual routines because the ventilation is outdated. We must relieve them.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Option C is in a ground-floor hall. My survey findings suggest that could lead to hazardous material delays. Option B, however, is open to all users.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Option B is a luxury. Option D is a necessity. Given the rising costs of mechanical plant, D will be expensive, but it's the only one that's essential.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@George, I agree that we must care for our staff. Option D seems like a project based on necessity rather than ""appeal,"" which means it's more likely to finish on time.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Yumi,,"But Option B is also open to everyone! @Mizuki, you said that's a good thing, right? It's like a mix of a specialist room and a general room!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,George,,"@Yumi, a recording studio doesn't help the person who has to manually open windows in a lab every morning. We have to prioritize the core infrastructure.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@George, I understand the urgency. However, Option D is a ""hidden"" improvement. Option B provides a visible, high-satisfaction benefit that is accessible to the whole campus.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Visibility is a poor metric for success, Mizuki. I'd rather we fund a project that prevents a total system failure than one that provides a fancy microphone.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I think I must side with George and Benjamin. We cannot keep squeezing a year of work into a few weeks. Option D is a necessary fix.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""George"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Yumi,,"I still feel for the students who can't find a place to study! But if the labs are in trouble, that's scary too. I want everyone to be safe!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,George,,"I appreciate that, Yumi. It is not just about safety, but about the dignity of the work. Our staff cannot continue like this.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,"I see the strength of the argument for Option D. While I value user satisfaction, the risk of failure in the labs is a greater concern for the community.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,"It is refreshing to see us prioritize the invisible, expensive reality over the visible, cheap fantasy. I believe we have reached a consensus.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Shizue,,Let us vote then. I hope this brings some peace and stability to our hardworking staff.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Yumi,,"I'll vote for what helps the most people in the long run, even if it's not as ""sparkly"" as a study hall!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,George,,I trust the committee has seen the necessity of this choice.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. The logical choice is the one that addresses the most critical failure point.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. Let us hope the actual cost doesn't frighten the administration too much.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
